      "description": "Pill tags in tinted pairs: measured, community, estimated.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tags\"><span class=\"ds-tag good\">measured</span><span class=\"ds-tag crema\">community</span><span class=\"ds-tag\">estimated</span><span class=\"ds-tag cool\">pre-infusion</span><span class=\"ds-tag bad\">rejected</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--sans)}.ds-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:.74rem;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-dim)}.ds-tag.crema{color:var(--crema);border-color:var(--tint-accent-border);background:var(--tint-accent-bg)}.ds-tag.good{color:var(--good);border-color:var(--tint-good-border);background:var(--tint-good-bg)}.ds-tag.bad{color:var(--bad);border-color:var(--tint-bad-border);background:var(--tint-bad-bg)}.ds-tag.cool{color:var(--cool);border-color:var(--tint-cool-border);background:var(--tint-cool-bg)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stat Tile",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "stat",
      "description": "Flat panel with an uppercase label and a mono reading.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stat\"><div class=\"ds-stat-label\">Avg shot time</div><div class=\"ds-stat-value\">28.4<span class=\"ds-unit\">s</span></div><div class=\"ds-stat-note\">last 7 shots</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stat{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:14px 16px;font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--text);width:200px}.ds-stat-label{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-faint)}.ds-stat-value{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:1.7rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin-top:4px}.ds-unit{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-faint);margin-left:3px}.ds-stat-note{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--text-dim);margin-top:2px}"
